# What each Pokémon is seen doing in Pokémon-Amie, an animation a sentence, said behind
# `[pa3ds.amie] descriptions`, the small movements it makes by itself behind `fidgets` too. The
# game says none of this. A message a Pokémon's national number and an animation, the models' own
# kw10_respond to kw60_touch, eating, nodding off and sleep one each: amie-motion-25-happyB is
# Pikachu's. One a form moving unlike its species adds its form, amie-motion-25-1-happyB Pikachu
# Rock Star's, and a female unlike her male adds f, and they are said before the species' own.
#
# Written by agents from the animations census (spike 287's `motions`): each model's every
# animation played at will on the research rig and pictured eight moments across, a sentence
# from the pictures alone (Orion, 2026-11-06), rewritten as whole sentences from the pictures
# cropped close (2026-11-08) after the style Orion took for Rock Star Pikachu's and Ralts's.
# The other languages' are a machine's translation of these (2026-11-08), to be corrected.
#
# Generation 1: Bulbasaur to Mew.

# Bulbasaur
amie-motion-1-drowse = { $pokemon } shuts its eyes and lets its head sink low. Then it jerks its head to one side and wakes with a smile.
amie-motion-1-eat = { $pokemon } opens its mouth wide, closes it, and opens it wide again. Then it chews with its mouth shut.
amie-motion-1-happyA = { $pokemon } ducks its head low with its eyes shut. Then it lifts it with a wide open-mouthed smile.
amie-motion-1-happyB = { $pokemon } hops from side to side with its eyes shut and mouth open wide, tilting its body with each hop.
amie-motion-1-happyC = { $pokemon } leaps high into the air with its eyes shut and mouth open. Then it lands and leaps up again.
amie-motion-1-hate = { $pokemon } jerks its head to one side with its mouth open. Then it ducks its head low with its eyes squeezed shut.
amie-motion-1-lonely = { $pokemon } turns sideways and hangs its head with its eyes half shut. Then it turns back to face forward.
amie-motion-1-mad = { $pokemon } lowers its head and glares. Then it raises it and opens its mouth wide.
amie-motion-1-moveA = { $pokemon } turns its head to one side and looks off. Then it turns back with its mouth open.
amie-motion-1-moveC = { $pokemon } shuts its eyes and opens its mouth in a wide smile, swaying slightly from side to side.
amie-motion-1-playA = { $pokemon } leans hard to one side with a front leg lifted and its mouth open. Then it leans the other way.
amie-motion-1-sleep = { $pokemon } lies flat on the ground with its eyes shut. Then it lifts its head, opens its mouth in a big yawn and stands up.
amie-motion-1-touch = { $pokemon } narrows its eyes and pushes its face forward. Then it draws back and blinks.

